    <briefdescription>
<para>Class for matching cones on both sides of the track. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is responsible for finding virtual cones on both sides of the track based on a set of given parameters (such as track width and maximum search parameters). The matching process considers cones on both sides of the track, calculates virtual cones where necessary, and returns matching results in terms of cone positions and match indices. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
